'''Margarana''' ([[wikipedia:Balinese language|Margaese]]: ᬫᬃᬕᬭᬦ) or in official form '''Kingdom of Margarana''' (Margaese: ᬓ᭄ᬭᬚᬦ᭄​ᬫᬃᬕᬭᬦ​ᬤ᭄ᬯᬶᬧ​ᬚᬬ, Krajan Margarana Dwipa Jaya) a sovereign state in the island of [[Marga Island|Marga]] located off the coast of mainland [[North Fosia|North]] [[Fosia]] in the [[Gulf of Praya]]. The country bordering by water with [[Sepitaria]] in south, [[Nusaraya]] in north and [[Pasundan]] in east. The government is constitutional monarch under the Raja of Margarana.

==Etymology==
The Word "Margarana" is derived from the Margaese words Marga and Prana. Marga which means “The Way”, whereas Prana means “Life Force”. The name was picked by Gusti Ngurah Bagus Jelantik, the successor of Agung Dynasty from the [[Kingdom of Samprangan]] during the breakout of [[Kingdom of Semarapura|Semarapura Kingdom]] on 1845 to vision the spirit of Margaese people on life. 
